	quest.535001000002000B.quest_subtitle: "Aether Literacy 章节证明：瓦尔基里女王。"
	quest.535001000002000B.title: "&5以太读写&r"
	quest.535001000002000C.quest_desc: [
		"&5The Renaissance&r closes on three proofs, one from each of its outer realms. Finish &6Valkyrie Queen&r in &bAether Literacy&r, &6Prismalite Gem&r in &dThe End Threshold&r, and &6Forge Trophy&r in &eStarlight Observation&r."
		"三章分别位于一个地牢或一个首领之后。其他文艺复兴章节会提供生存所需的装备和食物，但它们不会封锁时代。"
		"[ \"打开 \", { \"text\": \"工业革命之门\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"0B0310A0000000F0\" } }, \" 以查看。\" ]"
	]
